  "text": "Addlink adds S90 series PCI-Express4.0 (x4) NVMe SSD- 5000MB / sec and random 750000 IOPS News Comments 3 The addlink \"S90\" series is an NVMe M.2 SSD that supports PCI-Express4.0 (x4) connection. The form factor is M.2 2280, and the lineup includes two models with capacities of 1TB and 2TB. NAND Flash is a 3D TLC NAND with advanced wear leveling and powerful garbage collection capabilities. The maximum transfer speed is 5,000MB / sec for sequential reading, 4,400MB / sec for writing, 750,000 IOPS for random reading, and 700,000 IOPS for writing. The cache memory is DDR4, the main body size is 22 mm in width, 80 mm in depth, 3.5 mm in height, and weighs about 8.2 g. MTBF is 1.8 million hours and the product warranty is 5 years. Addlink is very active on Amazon, and offers at competitive prices. We have yet to receive pricing for these models though. Model number S90 1TB (ad1TBS90M2P) S90 2TB (ad2TBS90M2P) MPN 4712927862543 4712927862550 capacity 1TB 2TB Form factor M.2 2280 interface PCI Express Gen 4.0 x4 (NVM Express 1.3) Flash standard 3D TLC NAND DRAM cache DDR4 Sequential Read Speed Maximum: 5000MB / s Sequential Write Speed Maximum: 4400MB / s Random Read Speed (IOPS 4KB) Maximum: 750K IOPS Random Write Speed (IOPS 4KB) Maximum: 700K IOPS Operating environment temperature 0 ° C to 70 ° C (during operation) MTBF 1.8 million hours Warranty 5 years body size 80mm x 22mm x 3.5mm Body weight About 8.2g Addlink adds S90 series PCI-Express4.0 (x4) NVMe SSD- 5000MB / sec and random 750000 IOPS Share this content Twitter Facebook Reddit WhatsApp Email Print Next Level Racing GT Lite offers a racing sim seat specializing in GT positions Review: AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-core ZEN3 processor Downloads AIDA64 Download Version  8.40.8533 beta Download Intel ARC graphics driver 32.0.101.9175 FurMark Download v2.11.4 HWiNFO Download v8.55 CPU-Z download v3.02 NVIDIA GeForce 621.14 WHQL driver download AMD Radeon Software Adrenalin 26.10.2 driver download Articles Kioxia